Commodore 64 ROMs
=================

Downloaded from http://www.unusedino.de/ec64/technical2.html
Credited in turn to ftp://ftp.funet.fi/pub/cbm

basic.rom
---------
Commodore 64 BASIC V2. The first and only revision.

kernal.rom
----------
Commodore 64 KERNAL ROM Revision 3. The last revision, also used in
the C128's C64 mode.

character.rom
-------------
The character generator ROM.

kernal-sx64.rom
---------------
The SX-64's KERNAL, 251104-04. It boots with the SX-64's banner and
colours, and loads from device 8 rather than tape. Computer.new(kernal:
:sx64) fits it, as --model sx64 does.

Downloaded from
https://www.zimmers.net/anonftp/pub/cbm/firmware/computers/c64/kernal.sx.251104-04.bin
SHA-1 aa136e91ecf3c5ac64f696b3dbcbfc5ba0871c98.

dos1541.rom
-----------
The 1541 disk drive's DOS 2.6, 16 KB for $C000-$FFFF: 325302-01
($C000-$DFFF) followed by 901229-05 ($E000-$FFFF). Drive1541 loads it.

Both halves downloaded from
https://www.zimmers.net/anonftp/pub/cbm/firmware/drives/new/1541/
(1541-c000.325302-01.bin and 1541-e000.901229-05.bin) and concatenated.
SHA-1 ab16f56989b27d89babe5f89c5a8cb3da71a82f0.
